--- !u!1 &457115610951629150
GameObject:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  serializedVersion: 6
  m_Component:
  - component: {fileID: 6355079640982216233}
  - component: {fileID: 1049416611398539804}
  - component: {fileID: 8895253889290760704}
  - component: {fileID: 4838227195043229219}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: "Dear Emma,\L Hey there! I hope this letter finds you happy and doing well.
    It\u2019s been a while since we last talked, so I thought I\u2019d take a moment
    to write and catch up. Things on my end have been going pretty smoothly. Work
    has been keeping me busy, but I\u2019ve also been trying to make time for some
    fun\u2014reading a few good books and taking walks in the park. I\u2019ve been
    thinking about our last trip together and how much fun we had. It really made
    me miss spending time with you. How have you been? How\u2019s everything going
    with your job and your family? I\u2019d love to hear all about what you\u2019ve
    been up to lately. Let me know if you\u2019ve discovered any new hobbies or gone
    on any adventures. Let\u2019s try not to let too much time pass before we talk
    again. Maybe we can plan a phone call soon, or even meet up if we can swing it.
    I really miss our chats. Take care of yourself, and write back when you get a
    chance. I\u2019d love to hear from you soon. Warmly,\LJohn"
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
